{'symbol': 'META', 'date': '2022-05-31 16:05:00', 'title': "META PLATFORMS, INC. TO CHANGE TICKER SYMBOL TO 'META' ON JUNE 9", 'text': "MENLO PARK, CALIF. , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- META PLATFORMS, INC. (NASDAQ: FB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS CLASS A COMMON STOCK WILL BEGIN TRADING ON NASDAQ UNDER THE TICKER SYMBOL 'META' PRIOR TO MARKET OPEN ON JUNE 9, 2022."}